	"notes": {
		"rationale": "A phrasal compound is flat, every word a part, its front phrase never one Locution part (ADR 0054, the user on #1241, 2026-10-30): Rund, um, die Uhr and Betreuung. Rund links to the adjective rund, DWDS's one headword, whose rund um is an adverbial use, and which compares (runder, am rundesten; de/comparability-is-lexical). die joins Uhr, the noun that owns it as its article (de/noun-owns-its-article)."
